{"version":1,"content":"<p>《第52屆美國電影學院頒獎禮》將於下年4月27日在美國洛杉磯舉行，而「美國電影學院」（AFI）昨日就宣布荷里活紅星湯告魯斯（Tom Cruise）為下屆的終身成就獎得主。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;身兼演員與監製於一身的湯告</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:43.590439+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T00:14:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_hash":"0104a3f922d32c088010287c924ea33ac112694d096ca12de62055b0faec82e7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}